{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Adah the daughter of Elon</b> — she is Basemath the daughter of Elon, and she is called Basemath (Genesis 26:34) because she would burn incense with spices for idolatry. And Oholibamah is Judith; that wicked man gave her the name Judith, to say that she denies idolatry, in order to deceive his father."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:40:06.058111278Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}